      "stretched_h2o_m31_below_15_gib": "Phase 2M-D. An end-to-end feasibility run, not a storage measurement, and nothing here may stand in for it."
    },
    "what_this_does_not_establish": "Not that Phase 2M passes. Its go/no-go has three clauses and this record reaches one: no streaming policy exists to bound live operator rows, and no end-to-end run has completed the stretched-H2O M=31 configuration under a memory ceiling. A storage ratio measured on declared banks is also not a process-level reduction: it prices the retained rows, not the transient allocation a build passes through, and 2M-D's feasibility test stays the test precisely because no ratio can stand in for it."
  },
  "interpreter_dependence": "Byte counts of live Python objects are a property of the CPython build that measured them -- dict capacity, integer boxing and object headers are implementation details, not portable constants. The record declares its interpreter in provenance and the checker compares those fields under a declared relative tolerance, while every count, pair and packed byte stays exact.",
  "layout_comparison": {
    "banks_where_bytes_differ": [],
    "byte_identical_on_every_bank": true,
    "layouts": [
      "interleaved",
      "soa"
    ],
    "statement": "Interleaved keeps one complex128 array and structure-of-arrays keeps separate float64 real and imaginary arrays; both are sixteen bytes per coefficient, so the choice between them is one of access cost and not of size. The byte equality is checked here rather than assumed, because a layout that silently changed the footprint would make every reduction below ambiguous about which representation produced it."
  },
  "packed_bytes_per_coefficient": 24,
  "packed_model_statement": "Four bytes of ascending word index, four of the generation-order permutation, and sixteen of complex coefficient. That is the same 24 bytes MV.memory_estimate has always modelled and cached_operator_bytes has always reported; the permutation is not overhead added to the model, it is what lets the model be reached without moving an answer.",
